[61.174256, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\ngrep -nE \r\n'^\\[|^[a-z_]+:|var_dir|data_dir|queue_dir|log_dir|lock_dir|pid_file|list_data_dir|template_dir|messages_dir|archive_dir|bin_dir|etc_dir|mailman_user|mailman_gro\r\nup|owner|site_owner|incoming|configuration|lmtp_host|lmtp_port|smtp_host|smtp_port|default_domain|subscription_policy|volume' /etc/mailman3/mailman.cfg | head \r\n-200\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nls -la /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman 2>/dev/null | head; ls -la /var/lib/mailman3 2>/dev/null; find /var/lib/mailman3 -maxdepth 3 -type f 2>/dev/null |\r\nhead -50; echo '---aliases'; cat /etc/aliases; echo '---postfix config dirs'; ls -la /etc/postfix; echo '---master'; grep -nE 'smtp|lmx|local|virtual' \r\n/etc/postfix/master.cf | head -50; echo '---users'; getent passwd list mailman postfix; id list 2>/dev/null; id mailman 2>/dev/null\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠙\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
