[95.117457, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ngrep -nE '^\\[mailman\\]|^\\[mta\\]|^\\[paths|default_domain|site_owner|noreply|subscription_policy|posting|archive|mail_host|domain' \r\n/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman/config/schema.cfg | head -200; echo '--- schema mailman section'; sed -n '1,160p' \r\n/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman/config/schema.cfg; echo '--- mta section'; grep -n '^\\[mta' /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages/mailman/config/schema.cfg\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
